###

### Step 8: End the huddle
POST {{baseUrl}}/1/end
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Step 9: Generate summary
POST {{baseUrl}}/1/generate-summary
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Step 10: Check leaderboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/community/1/leaderboard

###

### Step 11: Check user streaks
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/1/streaks

###

# ==================== ACTIVITY TYPES REFERENCE ====================
# 
# AI_SLIDESHOW      - ChatGPT API generates slideshow
# AI_VIDEO_MESSAGE  - Gemini API generates 30 sec video
# DISCUSSION_TOPIC  - Reuses Thread/Post
# QUIZ              - New quiz interface
# DEBATE            - New debate interface
# CONTEST           - New contest interface
# VOTING_SURVEY     - Reuses Poll (Post with isPoll=true)
# REFLECTION        - Reuses Form (1-minute reflection)
# GUIDED_SESSION    - Reuses Session (breathing/silence)
# STORY_SPOTLIGHT   - Reuses Resource
# ANNOUNCEMENT      - Reuses Post (announcement type)
#
# ==================== FREQUENCY OPTIONS ====================
#
# DAILY
# WEEKLY
# FORTNIGHTLY
#
# ==================== AUDIENCE TYPES ====================
#
# ALL_MEMBERS
# SELECTED_MEMBERS
#
# ==================== LOCATION TYPES ====================
#
# DIGITAL
# OFFLINE
#
# ==================== LEADER SELECTION TYPES ====================
#
# USER       - Specified user is the leader
# RANDOM     - Random selection from attendees
# FIRST_LOGIN - First person to join becomes leader
# ROUNDROBIN  - Rotate through community members
